Any Commercial Use of Covered Software requires the Rights Holder's prior written authorization, including use in an unrelated commercial product or service. No permission in this license grants commercial rights, whether or not the use involves distribution, a Competing Product, or revenue directly attributable to the Covered Software.

Selling, offering, or commercially distributing a Competing Product derived from Covered Software requires prior written authorization under this section and Section 5. A free use or distribution is not thereby commercial, but it must still comply with the other restrictions, including Sections 4 and 5.

